    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm running a small organic kale operation out west and i've noticed some yellowing in the lower leaves. soil test shows my ph is at 6.2 and i just put down some compost. i need to boost nitrogen but i dont want to mess up the ph too much. should i go with bone meal or blood meal for the N levels?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
